<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-MEN'S GENERALI OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEN'S GENERALI OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KITZBUEHEL, Austria 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third round results</p>
<p>at the $535,000 Generali Open men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Julian Alonso (Spain) beat Bernd Karbacher (Germany) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat 13-Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) 6-3</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>9-Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat 7-Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 6-3</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>15-Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat 1-Thomas Muster</p>
<p>(Austria) 2-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>14-Galo Blanco (Spain) beat 3-Alex Corretja (Spain) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Stefan Koubek (Austria) beat Nicolas Lapentti (Ecuador) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>10-Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat 8-Juan Albert Viloca (Spain)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) leads 16-Renzo Furlan (Italy)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 4-5 - rain, match postponed to Friday.</p>
</text>
